:"明"}},{"title":"早朝七首 其四","author":"刘崧","text":"圣主潜心古帝王，武楼降辇步长廊。\n壁间不遣丹青涴，尽揭先儒衍义章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25300,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝七首 其五","author":"刘崧","text":"警跸初传夜未央，朱衣当殿簇班行。\n忽宣内使移宫炬，分照儒臣读奏章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25301,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝七首 其六","author":"刘崧","text":"东苑金河水慢流，水边芳草弄轻柔。\n晚凉小盖诸王出，争控雕弓试紫骝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25302,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早朝七首 其七","author":"刘崧","text":"天设皇居象紫庭，文昌执法粲群星。\n午门东北红云起，遥见钟山万丈青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25303,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"英德江上","author":"刘崧","text":"腊月炎州霜霰稀，清江白日燕交飞。\n四千馀里金陵路，何日征人度岭归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25304,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州杂韵","author":"刘崧","text":"垂根榕树三千尺，结子芭蕉百万头。\n异味荐盘随地有，繁阴压屋半天浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25305,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广州杂韵","author":"刘崧","text":"趋跄木屐儿童惯，织作蕉丝妇女能。\n老去只疑盐是雪，寒来不